  "teacherNotes": "Teacher-approved L384 single-character lesson. Base 250ca4a3361a15104ba19158bb1b0710dac43ecc; formal L001-L375, 379 learned characters; full allowed set 385. Learner dependencies L379-L383 (送連傳相信); no outside-coverage provisional. Release requires R045/R046 and L376-L383 in playable order. Dependencies block Release only. Stage 2 uses three 寫 and three prior learned distractors. G03 exactly 寫/畫/拿; G04 three single-Han cards 太/相/信. Handoff isCorrect is normalized to supported correct with unchanged answer mapping. S02 phone means contact number recorded on paper then digitally sent, not passing paper; no readable numerals. S04 matching illegible writing, not drawings. 寫 ㄒㄧㄝˇ; 相 in 相信/相同 ㄒㄧㄤ; 傳說 ㄔㄨㄢˊ. Teacher subjective review is post-main. NOT COMPLETED: G02 prefix 把電話 cannot reliably pass the exact-transcript/timing gate after 8 standalone generations (7 regenerations). Rejected latest candidate is retained only in ignored audio-inbox; shipping prefix is absent. Never substitute 打電話 or splice S02. Phone/tablet playback and final package validation remain pending. This is partial-package, not asset-complete.",
